    <key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Digisensus Recorder checks your browser's open tabs to name a browser call by its meeting app, like Zoom or Teams. Without this, the call is named after the browser.</string>
    <key>NSCalendarsWriteOnlyAccessUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Digisensus Recorder adds the meetings and deadlines agreed in a call to your calendar, only when you choose Add. It never reads your calendar.</string>
    <key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Digisensus Recorder adds a call's action items to Reminders, only when you choose to. It never reads your reminders.</string>
    <key>NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Digisensus Recorder records the other side of your calls, from the calling app or system audio, into the left channel of the recording.</string>
